<title>BRAZIL: Brazil orange juice industry reports weekly output.</title>
<headline>Brazil orange juice industry reports weekly output.</headline>
<dateline>RIO DE JANEIRO 1997-05-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Brazilian Association of Citrus Exporters reported the following output and exports of frozen concentrated orange juice in metric tonnes 66 Brix for the period May 19-25 and the total so far in 1996/97.</p>
<p>		     May 19-25   May 20-26	  TOTAL	  TOTAL</p>
<p>			1996/97     1995/96	1996/97	1995/96</p>
<p> Stocks/open    221,364.4   247,756.0</p>
<p> Production		 0	     0   1,089,679.4    973,306.9</p>
<p> Shipment	   7,563.4    36,520.2   1,030,476.6    899,220.6</p>
<p> Home Market	  416.7	 247.6	15,266.3     17,148.2</p>
<p> Stocks/close   213,384.3   210,988.2</p>
<p>((-Caroline Bulloch, Rio de Janeiro newsroom, 5521 5074151))</p>
